  <Thumbnail>24057654-fa9b-4346-a18c-acb0a25d13f3</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="13-06-03" Author="D.Shelton" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="15-07-03" Author="D.Shelton" Comment="Added head type" />
  <History Date="20-08-03" Author="D.Shelton" Comment="Added Gobo Names" />
  <History Date="09-02-04" Author="L.Gallagher" Comment="Error Found 1. No macros found" />
  <History Date="09-02-04" Author="L.Gallagher" Comment="Error Found 2. Eff Speed - No legends on preset positions" />
  <History Date="10-08-04" Author="Phil Rogers" Comment="Added macros, overhauled attribute names and added function wheels" />
  <History Date="16-02-05" Author="Dave Trounce" Comment="Tested against manual" />
  <History Date="16-02-05" Author="Dave Trounce" Comment="Error 1: Gobo Rot: CCW and CW are wrong way round.  Error 2: Prism CW and CCW are wrong way round." />
  <History Date="17-02-05" Author="Phil Rogers" Comment="Fixed above problems" />
  <History Date="18-07-06" Author="D4 Pers Fixer" Comment="Updated Colour ID to Colour1" />
  <History Date="18-07-06" Author="D4 Pers Fixer" Comment="Updated Colour Func ID to Colour1Func" />
  <History Date="18-07-06" Author="D4 Pers Fixer" Comment="Updated Gobo ID to Gobo1" />
  <History Date="18-07-06" Author="D4 Pers Fixer" Comment="Updated Gobo Func ID to Gobo1Func" />
  <History Date="18-07-06" Author="D4 Pers Fixer" Comment="Updated GoboRot ID to Gobo1Rot" />
  <History Date="18-07-06" Author="D4 Pers Fixer" Comment="Updated Pan Power on to Locate value" />
  <History Date="18-07-06" Author="D4 Pers Fixer" Comment="Updated Tilt Power on to Locate value" />
  <History Date="02-02-09" Author="D4 Personality Fixer 2009" Comment="Changed Attributes in Macros" />
  <History Date="14-04-09" Author="David Hunt" Comment="Fixed highlight and lowlight values" />
  <History Date="21-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased wheel resolution for 16bit attr.  Removed duplicate ID's.  Moved raw functions to else condition." />
  <History Date="21-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed Gobo1Rot update from Gobo1.  Shortened function names for Expert LCD." />
  <History Date="23-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised macros and added Gobo.  Fixed power on and locate." />
  <History Date="25-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Gobo1Rot to macros since Gobo1Func might change its condition." />
  <History Date="19-04-13" Author="RDM Sync Tool" Comment="Added RDM Manufacturer information." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="24-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Merged some of history to reduce length.  Added physical pan/tilt limits." />
  <History Date="24-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised P/T Speed function ranges.  Standardised shutter functions.  Recreated palettes." />
  <History Date="24-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added colour function index.  Standardised conditionals.  Added numbers to all colour functions." />
  <History Date="24-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised fixed colour ranges.  Added gobo function index.  Added numbers to gobo function names." />
  <History Date="24-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased gobo rot index wheel resolution.  Added full range colour index function." />
  <History Date="07-08-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added gobo swatches." />
  <History Date="08-08-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed gobo swatch order." />
